window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>The Heartbreak Show</i> is a continuation of <i>The Night Market</i> (listen to first), with major spoilers for Bound by Ravens. This audiobook includes <i>Heartshot</i>, a bonus content short story set in <i>The Night Market</i>, originally published in The Bookish Box's Romance Anthology Vol. II.</p> <p>A demi-mortal with a divine secret. A Raven shifter determined to a win a bet. And a quest that changes everything.</p> <p>Not all heroes wear armor, I was told when younger. Not even the warrior god whose namesake I chose at 13 when my sister and I ran away. A warrior god who left his known world . . . in a dress. But, darlin’, life is far more complicated than a faerie tale. Especially when you discover <i>you are one</i>.<br> <br> Aye, shocked me too. And very little surprises me. I focus, however, on winning a ridiculous bet made with the gorgeous Gent of Fem, the girl I love, in a bawdy coin beggar’s show for our tribe. But when my meddling great-aunt appears to me in the woods, I can no longer ignore my secrets.<br> <br> So now, like the heroes of old, I’m on an absurd quest to reclaim an even more laughable birthright. A heist that not only forces me to accept my darkness as well as my light, but one that also forces me to face two of my greatest fears. A broken heart . . . and Seren.</p> <p><i>The Heartbreak Show</i> is a new adult fae romantic fantasy set in the Bound by Ravens world and perfect for fans of: flirty rivals-to-lovers romance, cozy-ish, chosen mates, rom-com but make it fantasy, witty banter, touch him and die, feral for him, glamourous Victorian fashion, Irish mythology, a dash of slice-of-life, fluffy raccoons, chaos and whimsy, and smutty innuendos.</p>"; 
